      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "YuNet face detection\n\nThe 'CV YuNet Face Detect' node runs the YuNet CNN on the image. Put face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx in ComfyUI/models/onnx (already there) and pick it in the model combo. The node outputs DATA only: bounding boxes, the 5 facial landmarks per face as points, per-face confidence, and the face count. Visualization is separate: bboxes go to the core 'Draw BBoxes' node, then the landmarks go to 'CV Draw Points'. Lower conf_threshold to catch more (and more false) faces. Zero faces is a valid result (empty outputs)."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
